WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:03.839
Who is my girl?

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.200
My girl has love in her heart

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:10.740
and snow in her eyes

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.800
and peppermint in her blood.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.500
Happy birthday, kiddo.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.600
Mrs. Norris?

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.850
I'm very sorry for your loss.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:32.280
We have three suspects in custody, but they're all linked to the Garcia cartel.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.200
No witnesses have been willing to step up.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:38.920
These cartels are no joke. They've got everyone in their pockets.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.300
You've been through a terrible tragedy.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.840
Maybe you didn't see what you think you saw.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:47.960
That's him.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.720
Maybe you've made a mistake.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.680
Number three, number five, number four.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:57.600
They did it...
- Is it possible that your recollection isn't what you thought it was?

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:02.400
The evidence is insufficient to hold the defendants over for trial.

00:01:03.219 --> 00:01:05.249
You think that you're gonna have justice?

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:07.950
Make them all pay.

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:15.820
Five years ago, Riley North  just disappeared completely off the grid.

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:18.820
So she spends the last five years doing what? - Training.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.760
Well, that's new.

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:24.860
You honestly think Riley North did this?

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:28.160
Today's the five year anniversary of her family's murder.

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:32.220
She's back.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.120
Corrupt judges.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.640
Dirty cops.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.040
What do I want?

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.860
I want justice!

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.660
It's not a coincidence that makes this area low crime. It is low crime because of her.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.320
At least somebody's doing something.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:54.989
Find her. I don't care if you have to burn this city down.

00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:57.189
Watching someone take everything from you...

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.620
It turned you into somebody else.

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:03.860
Social media is lit up with support for her. - She's a multiple homicide suspect.

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:07.260
Not to them, she's not.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.900
How do you really think this is gonna go?

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:19.079
I will kill every one of you and I will pretty much wing it from there.

